'''Reshtini''' was a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[alien]] [[species]].  Members of the species could have [[Color|orange]] [[eye]]s on the sides of their head and could have tan and blue skin. The species had a long neck, a [[proboscis]], two small bumps on top of their heads, and two [[Limb|arms]] with multiple fingers. [[Kesmer Faloodi]] was a member of the species who [[Diet|ate]] [[noodle]]s at the [[Lomi Usqi Noodle Shop]] on the [[planet]] [[Ueda]]<ref name="Visual Guide" /> in [[132 BBY]].<ref name="Date">{{TheAcolyteDate}}</ref>

